-- src:730 | (7) A company that has been directed to change its name under this section may not, without the approval of the Secretary of State, subsequently change its name so that it does not include “limited” or one of the permitted alternatives.
-- src:731 | This does not apply to a change of name on re-registration or on conversion to a community interest company.
@ref s 64(7) Later change of name without limited needs approval (src:730-731)
GIVEN `the company has been directed to change its name under section 64` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the new name does not include “limited” or one of the permitted alternatives` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the change is a change of name on re-registration or on conversion to a community interest company` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 64(7) the approval of the Secretary of State is required for the change of name` MEANS
    IF NOT (`the company has been directed to change its name under section 64` AND `the new name does not include “limited” or one of the permitted alternatives`)
    THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A company that has been directed to change its name under this section may not ... subsequently change its name so that it does not include “limited”"
    ELSE IF `the change is a change of name on re-registration or on conversion to a community interest company`
         THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "This does not apply to a change of name on re-registration or on conversion to a community interest company"
         ELSE JUST TRUE -- the text says so: "may not, without the approval of the Secretary of State"

